{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17218040","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17218040","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1721804001:1":{"text":"约翰，帮我给风暴喂双份的草料，再检查一下马蹄铁。我需要它保持在最佳状态，待会我就要出——","source_cn":"约翰，帮我给风暴喂双份的草料，再检查一下马蹄铁。我需要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8037F23419CF7C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721804002:1":{"text":"早安，大小姐……哦不，格温妮丝队长。您不用急，风暴已经喂过了，吃的是最好的黑豆和燕麦。","source_cn":"早安，大小姐……哦不，格温妮丝队长。您不用急，风暴已经...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE503007841D23D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721804003:1":{"text":"马蹄铁昨晚刚换了新的，马鞍我也帮您装好了。","source_cn":"马蹄铁昨晚刚换了新的，马鞍我也帮您装好了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70471DB3233B3834","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721804004:2":{"text":"喂好了？我没有提前通知我要……出远门。","source_cn":"喂好了？我没有提前通知我要……出远门。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB743F64289EB5FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721804005:2":{"text":"格温妮丝走到战马旁，发现马鞍两侧的行囊鼓鼓囊囊的，甚至连备用的箭袋都挂在了最顺手的位置。","source_cn":"格温妮丝走到战马旁，发现马鞍两侧的行囊鼓鼓囊囊的，甚至...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6B0FCEB18CD2788","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_titl